          "kicker": "Squad call",
          "heading": "Jake White drafts Nathan Hughes into Fiji's extended squad for November Tests",
          "body": "Former England international Nathan Hughes will return to Test rugby in November after being drafted into Jake White's 35-man Fiji squad for the Nations Championship. Hughes won 22 England caps between 2016 and 2019. He is one of four uncapped players in the group, with Peniami Narisia, Marika Parker and Setareki Bituniyata, and Planet Rugby reports White could give all four their first Test caps this month."
