          "kicker": "Selection watch",
          "heading": "Henry Pollock given freedom to shine in Northampton's 28-14 win over Gloucester",
          "body": "Planet Rugby's takeaways from Saturday's 28-14 win at Franklin's Gardens frame Northampton's handling of Henry Pollock as a deliberate call, taking him out of the firing line so the recalled England powerhouse could shine. The Saints trailed 14-0 early before their forwards battered through the heart of Gloucester to level at the break, with Tom Pearson, back in the England picture this autumn, outstanding throughout, according to the Guardian."
