          "heading": "France beat Fiji 34-21 at home in their last meeting",
          "body": "Fiji's last visit to France came in the International Friendlies in November 2025, and they left on the wrong end of a 34-21 scoreline. In the log, France are 3 of 12, with two wins and one defeat from three matches. Across those three, France have scored 116 points and conceded 75. Their most recent result was a 42-15 win over Japan in Round 3."
