          "kicker": "Under 18 result",
          "heading": "Italy U18 beat Ireland 36-29 as Agressi try seals comeback",
          "body": "Italy's Under 18s beat Ireland 36-29 at Badia Polesine on Saturday, repeating last year's win in Cosenza after trailing 17-12 at the break. The Azzurrini were down to 13 men after Amurri's yellow card and Nikitakos's second yellow, and Ireland stretched the lead to 22-12. Fanzo's try got Italy back into it, and Agressi's try put them 26-22 ahead in the 15th minute of the second half. Captain Mesaglio had opened Italy's scoring."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Nathan Hughes drafted into Fiji's Nations Championship squad",
