      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Glasgow result",
          "heading": "Fergus Watson named Player of the Match as Glasgow beat Lions 28-20",
          "body": "Glasgow's 28-20 win over the Lions at Scotstoun on Halloween weekend was a showcase for Scotland's young talent, with Fergus Watson named Player of the Match after opening the scoring off a Dan Lancaster cross kick. Lancaster crossed for the second before half-time, and the Warriors led 19-3 at the break. The Lions rallied through Morne van den Berg and Siba Mahashe, but Ollie Smith's late try was not enough, and George Horne's late penalty denied them a bonus point."
        },
        {
