          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Leicester Fainga'anuku named in All Blacks' northern squad after missing July games",
          "body": "Stephen Donald, the former All Blacks fly-half, says Fainga'anuku's hybrid skill set could change how Rennie builds his bench. The 27-year-old, who has played mostly at centre or wing but started games at openside flanker in Super Rugby Pacific this year, can cover both 5-3 and 6-2 roles. Donald also floated a bench with two loose forwards. He is expected to feature in the matchday 23, with Rennie naming the first northern Test team next week."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
