    "467": {
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "edition": "Sunday 1 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Mchunu and Louw named in Erasmus' Nations Championship squad after Stormers win",
          "body": "Saturday's 33-7 win over Ulster in Cape Town was built up front, where Ntuthuko Mchunu and Wilco Louw regularly sent the visitors' scrum into reverse. That, plus the Stormers' maul superiority, let the hosts march up the field from their own half. Both Springboks have been named in Rassie Erasmus' Nations Championship squad, and the home side's excellence up front was a significant reason Ulster could not take advantage of the Stormers' handling errors."
